# What `npx vercel` must not upload (it deploys straight from this folder, not from GitHub).

# Secrets: production settings live in the Vercel dashboard, never in uploaded files.
# .env.local holds the local Supabase keys and would override them in the build.
.env*
!.env.example

# Installed and built on Vercel
node_modules
.next
.vercel
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only tooling (assets/ stays: the link preview images read its fonts)
bonus/__pycache__
supabase/.temp
supabase/.branches
